WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.636
With Shift Plus, location review can
suggest worked times for you to check.

00:00:05.486 --> 00:00:07.243
It doesn't mark a shift worked by itself.

00:00:08.543 --> 00:00:11.798
Open Settings, then Privacy, and find
Location Review.

00:00:12.698 --> 00:00:15.631
Turn it on, then check the access status
underneath.

00:00:16.481 --> 00:00:18.580
Your workplace also needs the right map
pin.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:24.942
Allow the location access the app asks for
if you want it to notice arrivals and
departures in the background.

00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.883
This recording shows the setup, not a real
journey.

00:00:29.782 --> 00:00:33.111
When a suggestion appears on Today, check
the times before confirming it.

00:00:33.961 --> 00:00:36.110
If the suggestion is wrong, edit or dismiss
it.
